3. Origin of the hardware designs under evaluation/

Recorded on 2026-10-02 from the files, from the history of the extension
repository in which they were first committed, and by comparison with the
pinned submodules. Licence as in section 1.

  evaluation/examples/01_full_adder to 08_sync_fifo
    Eight designs with their testbenches, pin constraints and OneWare project
    files. Committed by the author to the extension on 2026-06-28
    (FEntwumS.ContainerExtension, commit 3fc16ce) and moved here on
    2026-06-30. No other origin was found: the files carry no notice of one,
    and none of them occurs in the pinned submodules. The author's work; MIT.

  evaluation/integration/VHDL_Blink/VHDL_Blink.vhd,
  evaluation/integration/VHDL_Blink/VHDL_Blink_tb.vhd
    The OneWare Studio template BlinkSimulationVhdl with the project name
    VHDL_Blink filled in, identical up to white space (OneWare at a3a5a79,
    src/OneWare.Vhdl/Assets/Templates/BlinkSimulationVhdl/).
    LicenseRef-third-party.

  evaluation/integration/Verilog_Blink/Verilog_Blink.v
    The OneWare Studio template BlinkVerilog with the module name
    Verilog_Blink filled in (OneWare at a3a5a79,
    src/OneWare.Verilog/Assets/Templates/BlinkVerilog/).
    LicenseRef-third-party.

  evaluation/integration/iCE40_Flow/ice40_blink.v,
  evaluation/integration/ECP5_Flow/ecp5_blink.v,
  evaluation/integration/Formal_Verification/Blink.v
    Adapted from the same template: the module is renamed; ecp5_blink.v
    drives the LED from bit 23 of the counter instead of bit 20;
    Formal_Verification/Blink.v adds a formal assertion. ice40_blink.v and
    ecp5_blink.v are the input files of the measured workloads, and their
    SHA-256 stands in every result file. LicenseRef-third-party.

  evaluation/integration/Verilog_Blink/Verilog_Blink_tb.v,
  evaluation/integration/Verilog_Blink/sim_main.cpp,
  evaluation/integration/Formal_Verification/Blink.sby,
  evaluation/integration/iCE40_Flow/ice40_blink.pcf,
  evaluation/integration/ECP5_Flow/ecp5_blink.lpf,
  evaluation/integration/run_all.sh
    Committed by the author to the extension on 2026-06-12 (commit 8080bb1)
    and moved here on 2026-06-30. No other origin was found. The author's
    work; MIT.

  evaluation/integration/run_harness_smoke.sh
